        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"9c1607cc-6e4c-44a0-99ca-5a956bf8d382\",\"review_text\":\"Pathetic app now a days even it freezes and crahsed some times.. the playlist also gets scrambled... Too many bugs since last update...\"},{\"review_id\":\"77d0ccbd-a8f2-4ff4-8eb7-2756bad793b6\",\"review_text\":\"One of best music app💞❤️\"},{\"review_id\":\"7633e3c9-54f2-44e4-9c16-29caad0d8e93\",\"review_text\":\"Amazing App\"},{\"review_id\":\"d8bbde82-42f6-4c62-9f27-209fca593320\",\"review_text\":\"Recent update just ruined the app......use any alternative app\"},{\"review_id\":\"31af5a04-c998-4529-9db5-776018970ebe\",\"review_text\":\"They give u a good amount of song to listen to but sometimes it's frustrating bc they change the song u are listening to like example listening to 2055 they change to a different song like I was trying to fix but it doesn't work so 3.8 stars\"},{\"review_id\":\"eb3ecac4-41f8-4bbb-afe2-439e26edaaab\",\"review_text\":\"Love the app. But they changed the 💚 to a ✅ and now I'm kinda sad.\"},{\"review_id\":\"ed958e36-be9b-4286-837f-0fd62d4d3ed9\",\"review_text\":\"Now every thing goes to premium if you don't buy premium than this app is total waste for you 👎👎👎👎\"},{\"review_id\":\"9a8f6fb1-c66c-417c-9a77-592f6879b254\",\"review_text\":\"Best music aap\"},{\"review_id\":\"46f2858a-912f-4caf-88db-b3e3a37b3f8d\",\"review_text\":\"Jio savan and wynk is far better in terms of ads .... Spotify sucks\"},{\"review_id\":\"02993ac9-fc6e-4c48-9c86-989df8f9fe68\",\"review_text\":\"So amazing 🥰\"}]}"
